{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c57d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa16-3b54-7fb3-a8e8-7c1297771955"},"sequence":281,"recorded_at":1780531400000557,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"2c2593ed-ac6a-4422-9347-544e1af6ae8d","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"2c2593ed-ac6a-4422-9347-544e1af6ae8d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"2c2593ed-ac6a-4422-9347-544e1af6ae8d"},"call_id":"call_01a0aa16f3667549b74f41a58da32289","text":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-11-1\",\n  \"command\": \"export TASK_BOARD_DIR=/Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel/.task-board\\ntask-board q 'get(BUG-260916-1rqn1c) { full }; get(STORY-260916-19w99a) { full }' 2>&1 | head -c 20000\",\n  \"description\": \"Get full task and story\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"[{\\\"ac\\\":\\\"A narrow reproducible fix has independent review, exact prospective PR composition identity, targeted validation and honest hosted validation requirements handed to parent; real hosted CI publication and landing are separate parent delivery obligations.\\\",\\\"assignee\\\":\\\"[implementer] developer (muse)\\\",\\\"blockedBy\\\":[],\\\"blocks\\\":[\\\"TASK-260908-34gi0y\\\"],\\\"checklist\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Prove hosted failure and supported runner/toolchain alignment using source and official availability evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implement only narrow compatibility delta preserving native provenance and strict validation, separate exact prerequisite overlay.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Run relevant validation, publish exact candidate CR and prospective PR identity, and hand off with honest limitations.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Code written per task description and AC\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant tests written for new or changed behavior and passing\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"In a managed Story worktree the candidate is left UNCOMMITTED in the worktree for the handoff to snapshot — never commit on the Story branch. A producer commit moves the branch tip off the recorded checkpoint and the handoff refuses with change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint; repair with `git reset --soft \\\\u003ccheckpoint_oid\\\\u003e` before completing again.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every command, message, state, or refusal named in the AC is driven through the production entry point by a named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. Report coverage as a ratio — `n of m AC rows driven` — and name the production call site for each. Prose in place of the ratio is not evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior covered by negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject, with the production call site named\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every gate ships at least one NARROWING mutant — the gate stays present and is weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and a named test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lint clean\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant build/validation commands run after changes and build not broken\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"New outcome artifact attached on the board with a task-scoped name when the work produces notes, logs, screenshots, or other deliverables\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Important findings, decisions, anomalies, or regressions recorded in logbook when relevant\\\",\\\"done\\\":false}],\\\"children\\\":[],\\\"created\\\":\\\"2026-09-16T11:56:47Z\\\",\\\"derivedBlockedBy\\\":[],\\\"derivedBlocks\\\":[],\\\"description\\\":\\\"PR6 head d45c85d67b78b6578b5cb0821bd2e78217124d30 hosted run35091586150 passes macOS target builds, Swift tests and release build, then native packaging rejects Xcode16.4 build16F6 because NativeDependencies manifest pins17F42. Determine and implement smallest supported toolchain alignment preserving artifact provenance and strict validation.\\\",\\\"estimate\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"estimated\\\",\\\"scale\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"fibonacci\\\",\\\"number\\\":3}},\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260916-1rqn1c\\\",\\\"integrationCheckpointed\\\":false,\\\"isAdvisoryBlocked\\\":false,\\\"isBlocked\\\":false,\\\"name\\\":\\\"align-ci-native-xcode-toolchain\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"spawn agent resolution: Agent selection: muse via explicit_override (preferred_agentic_system: mixed[muse,codex,claude], config: spawn.preferred_agentic_system)\\\\nspawn queued: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260916-befff8, max_parallel=1)\\\\nspawn run started: [implementer] developer (muse) (run=RUN-260916-befff8)\\\",\\\"observability\\\":{\\\"readiness\\\":{\\\"advisoryBlockedElementIds\\\":[],\\\"blockedElementIds\\\":[],\\\"coverage\\\":{\\\"complete\\\":true,\\\"estimated\\\":1,\\\"ratio\\\":\\\"1/1\\\",\\\"total\\\":1,\\\"unestimated\\\":0},\\\"estimateKind\\\":\\\"estimated\\\",\\\"isAdvisoryBlocked\\\":false,\\\"isBlocked\\\":false,\\\"rolledEstimate\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"estimated\\\",\\\"scale\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"fibonacci\\\",\\\"number\\\":3}}},\\\"scope\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260916-1rqn1c\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"align-ci-native-xcode-toolchain\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"bug\\\"},\\\"summary\\\":{\\\"active\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"BUG-260916-1rqn1c\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"align-ci-native-xcode-toolchain\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"development\\\"}],\\\"blocked\\\":[],\\\"byType\\\":{\\\"bug\\\":{\\\"total\\\":1,\\\"todo\\\":0,\\\"active\\\":1,\