naged workspace,\\nwhether or not the run carries a delivery goal. Managed workspace activation\\nturns on role, task class, containing Story and local board alone, so an ordinary\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1302,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 326,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
