{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d635","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa16-3b54-7fb3-a8e8-7c1297771955"},"sequence":2421,"recorded_at":1780531400004837,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"2c2593ed-ac6a-4422-9347-544e1af6ae8d","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"2c2593ed-ac6a-4422-9347-544e1af6ae8d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"2c2593ed-ac6a-4422-9347-544e1af6ae8d"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\n**Outcome:** `BUG-260916-1rqn1c` is `to-review`, checklist 14/14, with two outcome artifacts attached. The candidate is uncommitted in the Story worktree (HEAD unmoved at `b3422b0`): 59 staged PR6-overlay files (all blobs byte-equal to PR6 head `d45c85d`), plus the new delta — `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (10+/2−), `scripts/select-native-xcode.sh`, and two test files.\n\n**Fix:** hosted run 35091586150 failed `native-packaging` because `macos-15` cannot provide the manifest-pinned Xcode 26.5 (17F42) — its newest is 26.3 (17C529), and I verified this against the official runner-images inventory. The narrow fix moves the credential-free job to GA `macos-26` (arm64, so the Mise checksum pairing holds) and adds an explicit selection step: the new script reads both manifest pins, refuses on disagreement/unknown builds, selects `/Applications/Xcode_26.5.app`, and verifies `Build version 17F42`. The explicit selection is necessary, not just the image move, because the macos-26 default is Xcode 26.6 (17F113). No manifest, artifact, product, or strict-check changes.\n\n**Validation (all exit codes observed):** new 12-test suite green (it failed pre-fix on the overlay tree); mutant harness green with both mutants killed — the narrowing `admit-macos26-default-only` by its named test, and the token-preserving `select-wrong-app` (keeps every `17F42`, selects Xcode 26.6) by the full behavioral suite on the recorded path. `make check-native-dependencies` (the exact hosted failing command) passes locally where the toolchain matches; the strict downstream gate still rejects Xcode 26.6 with exit 1 via a `DEVELOPER_DIR` override (no system mutation). Also: workflow YAML valid, `swift build` exit 0, neighbor diagnostics 3/3, `git diff --check` clean, no linter configured. AC coverage is 4 of 6 rows driven, with independent review and hosted publication/landing declared as stated bounds.\n\n**Honest bounds for parent:** hosted green requires publishing the prospective PR (PR6 head + 4-path delta) — a parent delivery obligation. The image move upgrades the whole job from Xcode 16.4/Swift 6.1 to Xcode 26.5/Swift 6.3-class; local evidence is green but hosted confirmation is pending by construction. Full `credential-free-validate` wasn't run locally (needs the legacy checkout).","reason":null}}
